cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EQGAT-diff in a property-driven molecular design loop on OE62"
abstract: >-
  Code for replacing the G-SchNet generator in a closed-loop property-driven
  molecular design workflow with EQGAT-diff, an E(3)-equivariant diffusion
  model, while holding the OE62 dataset and the SchNet-style property
  surrogate fixed.
type: software
